  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nIt seems like  13f084e broke the complement.sh script included here, it doesn't find any tests to run anymore:\r\n\r\n```\r\nSuccessfully built 41beaabb3d44\r\nSuccessfully tagged complement-synapse:latest\r\nno Go files in /home/bubu/projects/oss/synapse/complement-master\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen manually reverting the changes to that file it works again (the actual tests fail somewhere down the line, but that another matter).\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- run `./scripts-dev/complement.sh` from an up-to-date synapse checkout",
